<title>GREECE: FUNDS PICK VLAHAKIS AS BOURSE BOARD MEMBER.</title>
<headline>FUNDS PICK VLAHAKIS AS BOURSE BOARD MEMBER.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Union of Institutional Investors picked George Vlahakis to represent them on the Athens stock exchange board of directors, it said on Monday.</p>
<p>Vlahakis is the general manager of European Reliance Fund Management.</p>
<p>Meanwhile Athens stock exchange member brokers were voting to pick their representatives on the bourse's nine-member board of directors. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
